-- One-time: DO-GRIP's uses from the ISCAR intranet e-catalog (the Groove-Turn
-- & Parting families under the DO-GRIP logo; the square DGAQ adapters are on
-- LOGIQ-F-GRIP), in two categories, Inserts and Tools & adapters, each family
-- linked to its page; families with the same description share a use. Uses
-- DO-GRIP already has (same name, ignoring case) are kept; the new ones follow.
